values ('ap_chemistry', 7, '7.7', array['7.7', '7.10']::text[], 'convention', 'Comparing Q with K to find the direction', 'Q < K: net consumption of reactants and formation of products; Q > K: net consumption of products and formation of reactants; Q = K: dynamic equilibrium with constant proportions.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-chem-u5-u9-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u7-r1-013; ced=7.7.A.2 "When Q < K, the reaction will proceed with a net consumption of reactants"')
