values ('ap_chemistry', 7, '7.10', array['7.10']::text[], 'convention', 'Which stresses change Q and which change K', 'A disturbance makes Q differ from K and the system shifts to restore Q = K; concentration-type stresses change Q only, while a temperature change changes K itself.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-chem-u5-u9-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u7-r1-017; ced=7.10.A.2 "changes in concentration, cause a change in Q only. A change in temperature causes a change in K."')
